Usage: tomb <COMMAND>

Commands:
  init    
  add     
  done    
  start   
  cancel  
  list    
  show    
  sync    
  inbox   
  review  
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
